OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested over 'sophisticated'
OL,4,Aoperation to grow 300 cannabis plants
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after police
OL,7,Fdiscovered about 300 cannabis plants in
OL,8,FCounty Armagh.
OL,10,FPolice made the discovery of the
OL,11,Fplants, which were growing across rooms
OL,12,Fin outbuildings and sheds at a property
OL,13,Fin the Moy Road area of Portadown, at
OL,14,Fapproximately 19:15 BST on Wednesday.
OL,16,FWhen the officers arrived a man
OL,17,Fattempted to make off from the scene
OL,18,Fafter coming out of a static caravan
OL,19,Flocated in the area.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
