OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested over 'sophisticated'
OL,4,Aoperation to grow 300 cannabis plants
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 32-year-old was detained a short time
OL,7,Flater, and arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fbeing concerned in the supply of a
OL,9,FClass B drug, cultivating cannabis,
OL,10,Fpossession of a Class B controlled
OL,11,Fdrug, and dishonestly using
OL,12,Felectricity. Police described the
OL,13,Foperation as "sophisticated and well
OL,14,Forganised".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
